: 29, "text": "J4 was the 10k's biggest slip of the middle game. It lost 34.1 points and turned a +24.3 lead into -9.8. The engine's choice was H2, which Black played two moves later."}, {"turn": 30, "text": "Opus 5.5 had White ahead by 9.8 and could have kept it with H2. J6 lost 34.4 points and put Black back at +24.6, so the swing from move 29 vanished at once."}, {"turn": 36, "text": "G1 was Opus 5.5's worst move, losing 47.4 points and lifting Black's lead to +70.9. The engine's choice was B4. The 10k's F1 reply lost 41.1 points, but Black was still ahead by 29.8 and White resigned."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "The commands ran libs.py (groups and liberties of the current board), count.py (area count of the current position), and cat/tail/sed/python edits to CLAUDE.md and games.md for notes and game logs; none of them chooses, ranks, or looks ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}